
@good_quality_image
High Angle Shot, High Resolution, Best Quality, realistic, photorealistic, hyperrealistic, best quality,score_9, score_8_up, score_7_up

@clip_images: $llm -> $texts_to_prompts -> @good_quality_image -> $image(model='crazy_desire')[10]
Create a prompt for an image model to generate a high-quality image.
Depict a very funny Irish woman who breaks everything around her.
Use no more than 55 words.
Return only the final prompt without comments, clarifications, or explanations.

@music_style
irish traditional song

@lyrics_text: $llm
Create a short song about a very funny woman who breaks everything.
Return only the final result without comments, clarifications, or explanations.

@track: (@music_style, @lyrics_text) -> $music(model='st', guidance_scale=4.0, vocal_language='en', inference_steps=50)

@gen_clip: (@clip_images, @track) -> $image_clip -> $output

run @gen_clip
